DATA NOTICE: ced

Data files (dvc imports; not stored by HeCBench, fetch with `dvc pull`):
  input/, output/ (input.dvc, output.dvc)

What:
  110 grayscale video frames (354x626, as text) and the expected Canny
  edge-detection outputs.

Source:
  Chai benchmark suite, https://github.com/chai-benchmarks/chai,
  CUDA-D/CEDD/input and CUDA-D/CEDD/output, imported at commit 61db988.
  The frames come from the Peppa Pig episode in Chai's
  utils/convert_frames/input/PeppaPigandSuzieSheepWhistle.mov.

